  "description": "The Geekvape Sonder Q3 Pod Vape Kit delivers impressive everyday performance within a highly portable, pocket-friendly design. Engineered for both new and experienced users, this lightweight pod system houses a surprisingly substantial 1750mAh built-in battery. Capable of up to 30W of output, it provides consistent and stable power throughout the day, while the convenient 5V/2A USB-C fast charging connection ensures downtime is kept to an absolute minimum. Operating the device is incredibly straightforward thanks to the responsive draw-activated firing mechanism. A multi-colour LED indicator provides real-time battery status updates at a glance, completely eliminating any guesswork. The inclusion of a precise sliding airflow control allows you to tailor your draw exactly to your liking, transitioning smoothly from a tight mouth-to-lung inhale to a looser restricted direct-to-lung vape. The Sonder Q3 is fully compatible with the highly regarded Geekvape Q Pod series, providing excellent versatility for various vaping styles. The kit includes a 2ml Q Cartridge featuring an intuitive side-fill design to minimise mess during refills. The integrated mesh coil technology ensures a rapid heating response for clear, consistent flavour delivery, making this kit an excellent choice for pairing with both 50/50 e-liquids and Nicotine Salts. Browse our extensive selection of vape liquid and find a delicious companion for your kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
